WEBVTT

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.120
Hey... Fudo.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:11.860
Yeah?

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.570
Do you think... maybe...

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.370
Hey, look at that!

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:20.000
I b-baked the cookies this morning.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.460
I don't know if you'll like them, but...

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.160
They're shockingly delicious!

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.670
Really?

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.910
I'm so glad.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.360
Fudo? What's the matter?

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:47.210
Just...

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:50.490
On a day with the perfect date weather,

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:53.020
eating sweet things made by 
the person I love the most...

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:56.040
Desumi-san...

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm the luckiest man in the universe.

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:01.960
You just love to exaggerate.

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:56.730
Ah, Desumi-san...

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:58.350
You are beautiful.

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:00.720
I could look at you for hours.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.640
Stare...

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:06.300
C'mon, don't stare!

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.100
You're not even blinking!

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:10.620
But don't get the wrong idea!

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:13.770
It's not that I don't like it.

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:18.110
I'm just not... used to it.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:19.590
Oh so cute...

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:19.990
<b>Oh so cute...</b>

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:21.770
Desumi-san...

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:24.700
I have a serious favor to ask you.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:25.770
A favor?

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:33.450
According to the specialist 
texts I consulted on the topic,

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:36.510
couples are supposed to hold hands.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:39.260
Do you think <i>we</i> could try it?

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:42.970
H-Hold hands? Us?

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.410
I can't do it!

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.200
It's just too soon for us!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.150
Desumi-san!

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:02.390
I said I can't do it!

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:03.120
But...

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:05.060
T-Think about it, Fudo!

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:08.350
This is only our third-ever date!

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:09.540
It's premature!

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:13.130
Statistics suggest that hand-holding tends 
to happen on the second or third date!

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:15.290
The average couple is incredible!

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:46.450
You okay up here, Red?!

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.210
<b>Allow me to explain!</b>

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:52.210
<i>Allow me to explain!</i>

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:56.960
<b>Freezing Sentai Gelato 5</b>

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:56.960
<i>Freezing Sentai Gelato 
5's leader, Red Gelato,</i>

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.960
Aikawa

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.960
Fudo

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.960
<i>a.k.a. Fudo Aikawa...</i>

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:04.840
<b>Secret Society Gekko</b>

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:03.070
<i>and leader of combatants 
for Secret Society Gekko,</i>

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:07.430
<i>the Reaper Princess, a.k.a. Desumi Magahara...</i>

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.850
<b>Desumi Magahara</b>

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:11.230
<i>have climbed the insurmountable wall 
that stands between their organizations</i>

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:14.160
<i>to engage in a taboo relationship!</i>

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:52.660
Episode 1    I Love You!

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:50.160
<i>What an intense battle!</i>

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.660
<i>I don't think there's 
anything I can do to help.</i>

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.570
I'm leaving this to you, Red!

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.330
Desumi-san...

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.980
We're holding hands right now.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:10.780
Y-You mean... we did it?

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:11.180
We did!

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:13.800
Isn't it wonderful, Fudo?

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:21.620
And doing it with interlocked 
fingers like we did

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.230
is apparently a very advanced act!

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:27.870
It's a day worth remembering—
the first time we held hands.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:30.510
<i>Desumi-san...</i>

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:33.900
<i>My first-ever girlfriend.</i>

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:38.750
<b>1 Week
 Earlier</b>

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.710
<i>I'm so glad I worked up my courage that day!</i>

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:38.750
<b>Hero Sentai
Gelato 5 Headquarters</b>

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.470
<b>Red Gelato
Fudo Aikawa</b>

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:54.300
Good morning, Fudo-senpai!

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:56.630
Hey. Morning, Haru-kun.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:58.430
<b>Pink Gelato
Haru Arisugawa</b>

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:58.430
You can use this, if you like.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.470
Thanks, I appreciate it.

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:01.740
It's nothing, really.

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:03.690
But I guess it's almost time 
for the meeting, right?

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.290
Want to walk there together?

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.860
<b>Refreshing!
Goes down easy!</b>

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.860
<b>For building ideal muscles

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.860
<b>The Rich Flavor

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:06.860
<b>Delicious Milk</b>

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:05.970
Sure thing.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.120
C'mon, don't be shy!

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:12.870
A date with me is all 
the excitement you need!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.870
Actually... I'm rather busy...

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.870
Hayato-san's at it again.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:19.450
<b>Blue Gelato
Hayato Ojino</b>

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:17.460
Where should we go?

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:19.450
Karaoke? A club?

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:22.500
Excuse me, I have to...

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:22.950
Just don't fall in love too fast 
when you see me on the dance floor!

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:24.250
Just leave it all to me.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.250
Hey!

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:27.250
Providing a cool escort for 
an adorable little kitten

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.670
is my form of justi—

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:35.010
She knows she wants me.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:40.080
Look at you, right on time!

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.730
<b>Yellow Gelato
Misaki Jinguji</b>

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:43.480
<b>Green Gelato
Daigo Todoroki</b>

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:42.430
It seems we're all here.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:44.500
All right!

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:55.190
Good morning, Gelato 5!

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:55.820
<b>Gelato 5 Commander
Professor Big Gelato</b>

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:57.220
Good morning, sir!

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:58.310
Morning!

00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.560
Mornin'!

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:00.990
Good morning!

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:03.520
Professor, the package you requested.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:06.330
It's appreciated as always, Daigo-kun.

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:10.130
What a fine smell!

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.770
Croissants!

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:13.970
Hey, can I have some too?

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.950
Of course you can!

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:19.140
Feel free to help yourselves while I talk!

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.230
Reaper Princess...

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:31.000
A powerful Gekko combatant who began 
appearing roughly six months ago.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:36.620
As you all know, Gekko is a secret 
society plotting world domination.

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:41.250
But the appearance of the Reaper Princess has 
made them more formidable than ever.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.760
I want you all to engage her with caution!

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:50.300
<i>Secret Society Gekko appearance detected.</i>

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:53.260
<i>Gelato 5, move out at once.</i>

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:57.800
Gelato 5, move out!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.930
Help!

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:13.190
<b>Princess Series
Reaper Princess</b>

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:13.190
<b>Gekko Monster
Culverin Bear</b>

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:13.190
<b>Moonlight
 Soldiers</b>

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:12.530
Cower in fear, pathetic humans!

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:14.610
It's Gekko!

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.820
Man, Culverin Bear is huge!

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:18.810
That's enough of that!

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.350
There you are!

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:22.830
They're here!

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:31.250
Freezing Change!

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:33.010
<i>Five!</i>

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:34.460
<i>Four!</i>

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:35.920
<i>Three!</i>

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:37.380
<i>Two!</i>

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:39.010
<i>One!</i>

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:43.050
<i>Change Gelato!</i>

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:59.280
The aroma of strawberry, 
the flavor of justice!

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:01.440
Red Gelato!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:05.540
The aroma of soda, the flavor of courage!

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:07.600
Blue Gelato!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.810
The aroma of lemon, the flavor of life!

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:13.780
Yellow Gelato!

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:18.050
The aroma of peach, the flavor of love!

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:20.160
Pink Gelato!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.680
The aroma of pistachio, the flavor of peace!

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.670
Green Gelato!

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:29.560
Together, we are...

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.070
Freezing Sentai Gelato 5!

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:37.200
Underestimate us on pain of fire!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.200
We'll have our revenge at last!

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.100
Get them!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:49.360
Sweet Berry Impact!

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:57.130
Megaton Lemon Crush!

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:04.270
Sky Peach Rain!

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:13.060
Vacuum Pistachio Strike!

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:21.320
Twin Soda Slash!

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:24.240
Heroes rock!

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:29.340
Impressive as ever, Gelato 5!

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:33.540
But the rest won't be so easy!

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:57.770
The rest of you, handle Culverin Bear!

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.900
I'll take the Reaper Princess!

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:01.280
Let's go!

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:02.280
Right!

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.460
Retreat!

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:43.400
Let's call it off for now!

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.880
B-But I'll get you next time!

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:52.180
I've never met someone who 
could keep up with me before.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:58.540
Perhaps this is what they call destiny.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:02.360
We'll meet again... Red Gelato.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.410
Lick, lick...

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:19.400
<i>Fighting in the morning, 
training in the afternoon?</i>

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:23.980
<i>He's a role model for all heroes 
with a work ethic like that.</i>

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:55.430
What's going on in your life, boy?

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:58.940
Don't you do anything but bodybuilding?

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:03.150
There's something on my mind.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:03.940
Oh?

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:06.020
<i>Knowing Fudo-kun,</i>

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:10.240
<i>he's probably mulling over issues of world 
peace, or perhaps the nature of justice.</i>

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.880
I was thinking about the woman I love.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.620
<i>What?!</i>

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.460
F-Fudo-kun!

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:19.880
Y-You've developed a crush?!

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:21.700
It was love at first sight.

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:24.900
I've never been in love before now!

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:27.580
H-Have you told her how you feel?

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:28.340
Of course not.

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:30.520
I'm a hero.

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:33.100
She and I live in two different wo—

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:35.100
Fool!

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:36.510
P-Professor?

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:39.120
What's there to say a 
hero can't fall in love?

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:40.770
You're as human as the rest of us!

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.650
You must tell her how you feel at once!

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:44.650
But...

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:46.150
That's an order!

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:47.490
Are you sure, Professor?!

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:52.880
Love will bring you to the 
next stage of your life!

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:54.910
I'll take responsibility 
for whatever happens!

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:57.910
Very well, sir!

00:14:58.280 --> 00:14:59.260
I'm off!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:05.360
<i>I always thought his single-minded 
focus on bodybuilding was sad,</i>

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:08.170
<i>but it's good to see he's 
a red-blooded young man!</i>

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:14.070
<i>But what kind of woman could it 
be, who's stolen Fudo-kun's heart?</i>

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:16.920
<i>Could it be a nurse, perhaps?</i>

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:18.640
<i>I've a fondness for nurses myself!</i>

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:34.640
I was surprised by your invitation 
to this little tête-à-tête, Red.

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:38.160
But you don't have to explain...

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:41.410
You want to pick up where we left off, right?

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:44.950
I was hoping to settle things myself!

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:55.050
What is it?

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:04.810
I love you!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:05.900
Wha?

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:07.940
<b><i>Clink...</i></b>

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:10.920
Love After World Domination!

00:16:13.270 --> 00:16:14.370
I love you!

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:15.220
I love you!

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:16.490
I love you!

00:16:17.070 --> 00:16:18.030
I love you!

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:21.660
From the moment we first met...

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.030
I've loved you!

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.880
I just wanted to tell you—

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:29.000
Now hang on a second!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:29.850
Are you nuts?

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:31.490
We're mortal enemies, remember?!

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:32.470
I'm perfectly sane!

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:33.820
Did you hit your head somewhere?

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:34.530
Don't worry.

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:36.640
I got Professor Big Gelato's permission.

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:39.130
Exactly, there's no way he'd permit—

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:40.070
What?!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:44.710
Of course... I see your game now.

00:16:46.010 --> 00:16:51.370
You know I've had no experience with such 
things... and you're teasing me about it.

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:53.360
How humiliating!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:54.400
<i>Squee...</i>

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:55.740
<b>squee</b>

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:58.010
Using that as a pretext 
to throw me off my game...

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:01.450
I'm disappointed in you, Red!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:02.790
No, I swear—

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.540
You'll pay for this, fiend!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:08.420
It's not like that, Desumi-san!

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.660
I haven't given you 
permission to use my name!

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:14.510
No man could possibly ever love me!

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:19.050
I'm the kind of woman...

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:23.450
whose comrades spread rumors that 
my favorite food is raw bear meat!

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:27.980
It's not! Your favorite foods 
are pancakes and pasta!

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:30.430
How would you know that, creep?!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.940
They also say that I drink 
the blood of wild boars!

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:37.990
No! You mainly drink green smoothies!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:41.030
They say I wander the streets at 
night seeking strong men to beat up!

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:42.580
At night, you do Pilates!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:45.710
That I'm an alien killing machine!

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:55.730
You were born...

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:58.380
in Hakata!

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:00.890
How did you know all that?!

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:09.020
Desumi Magahara

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:09.020
m 355 179 l 357 234 460 233 469 202 458 182

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:09.020
1 like 
I made mentaiko pasta
#homecooking
#wishIwasbetteratit

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:04.340
I looked through all your 
social media accounts.

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:08.750
Hello there, it looks delicious

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:09.020
And those replies from "Proteinman"... 
They're from me.

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:09.020
Hello there, it looks delicious

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:13.020
You're no killing machine.

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.280
You always do your nails up in a cute way,

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:17.400
you love your fancy accessories,

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:20.310
and you change up your perfume 
based on how you feel that day.

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:23.140
You're as real as a girl can be.

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:26.670
Real girls don't wield flails.

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:28.990
Don't worry. I'll catch it.

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:31.620
B-But we're enemies!

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:33.170
I think we can work it out!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.550
But...

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.540
Would you please be my girlfriend?

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:41.510
I-It's not possible—

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:44.110
Desumi-san, I mean this!

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:00.450
Fine.

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:09.330
I... I'm looking forward to it.

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:16.200
B-But just so you know, I don't know 
anything about the mechanics of dating!

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.450
Don't worry. I don't know, either!

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:26.700
<b>And now...</b>

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.140
By the way, Fudo.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.740
When I headed out this morning, 
my cat did the funniest—

